            <div class='post' itemprop="text">
              <p>I spoke with Bryan Colligan and Eric Waisanen from AlphaGrowth about the Cardano Prime proposal and whether it can help fix Cardano DeFi. We covered liquidity gaps, stablecoin and money market infrastructure, incentives, treasury accountability, KPIs, community oversight, and the execution risks around building a stronger DeFi stack on a UTXO chain.</p>
